      "content": "It's getting there, but it still feels a bit thin for a full report. I need you to really dive deep into the \"why\" behind these shifts. \n\nMaybe you could add a section on how these specific houses are influencing the broader lifestyle market—like how the aesthetic of one brand might influence home decor or even hospitality, for instance. Try to make it a long, comprehensive deep dive. \n\nI'm seeing the SEO score coming in a bit lower than the senior editors usually like, but I'm telling you again: do NOT just repeat the brand names. If you start writing nonsense like \"the Prada Prada style is very Prada,\" the whole piece is going in the trash. Just make the analysis more substantial and thorough, and the brand mentions will naturally follow the quality.",
